 1440: 					 *  once.)
 1441: 					 *
 1442: 					 *  *** THE THREE DRIVER CLAIMS IN THIS COMMENT ARE
 1443: 					 *  SEAT-REPORTED, NOT VERIFIED LOCALLY.  There is no copy
 1444: 					 *  of Linux's drivers/cdrom/gdrom.c or NetBSD's
 1445: 					 *  sys/arch/dreamcast/dev/gdrom.c anywhere in this tree, so
