  322: #  absent rows is worse than no banner.
  323: #
  324: #  Coverage of the four de-fatalised predicates: `accept d0`/`accept d1` carry
  325: #  the two read predicates and the busy mask, the 204 good reads inside
  326: #  `overread` carry data_len, and `accept w8` carries the width predicate.
  327: #
  328: #  The values are device-signature quality -- RAM cannot produce them, and
  329: #  they come from the synthesized TOC (d->data[0]=0x10, then 0x9600).
